# Created: 2026-07-30
# Last updated: 2026-08-04

# Large regenerable data pools (Stim + gen-seed; NOT committed -- 16G). Regenerate via
# generate_pools.py / make_fresh_tail.py, or pull from EAF ~/rcnn_threshold/.
*.npz

# Exception: the fixed 200k evaluation tail IS committed. Every reported p_L in this
# repo is scored against this exact array, so without it the numbers can be re-run but
# not reproduced. Keep it tracked deliberately, despite the *.npz rule above.
!experiment_log/results_snapshot/eaf/rcnn_threshold/pools/data_d5_p0.010_r3_TAIL200k.npz

.DS_Store
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Python environment. The pinned TF 2.15 env is a uv .venv inside the repo; uv writes
# its own ignore file in there, but do not rely on that -- rebuild the env without it
# and the whole tree becomes stageable.
.venv/

# Jupyter autosave copies. Not research artefacts, and they shadow the real notebook.
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Raw stdout from training and generation runs. Useful locally while a run is live;
# meaningless to anyone else, and the same information is recorded in docs/RUN_LOG.md
# and the per-run .history.json files.
experiment_log/logs/

# Crumble / detector-slice HTML dumps (~1.3 MB each). Regenerated on demand by
# analysis_notebooks/failure_case_explorer.ipynb and visualize_spacetime.ipynb.
experiment_log/plots/

# Private working notes -- NEVER commit. Planning and strategy material and
# personal working context, not research artefacts. Local only, by decision.
private_notes/
PROJECT_NOTES.md

# Editor and tooling scratch files.
*.original.md
